From 641714e5e897ac8c2fc1d371b4bccd93cfb628e9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: salvia420-bit <salvia420@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 19:35:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Vehicles (holtburger fork): Unified ISO 6780 1100mm pallets &
 2-wide grid

Unifies all 9 modular deployables (WCID 4000002, 4000010-4000017) onto a single ISO 6780 1.100 x 1.100 x 0.145 m pallet and replaces the asymmetric 10/21-slot pinwheel + half-pallet subslot layout with a clean 2-wide container grid (10 slots in 20ft [2x5], 20 slots in 40ft/40HC [2x10], x = +/-0.575m, orient = Y, independent Left/Right LIFO lanes).

Retains HBV1 v7 wire compatibility (VehicleWire.Version = 7, deprecated PalletSize.Half = 1 enum retained, SubSlot normalized to 0). Updates BatteryDeployable, GroundRadarDeployable, MortarTurretDeployable, LaserTurretDeployable, ContainerLogistics, IsoContainerDeployable, PalletJackDeployable, VehicleCommands (@container preset fob20/fob40 and @trailer preset sidelifter*), and ACE.Server.Tests/Vehicles.

Verified: dotnet test --filter FullyQualifiedName~Vehicles (364/364 passed).
